 "heading": "ORACC",
 "paragraph": "The Open Richly Annotated Cuneiform Corpus publishes edited Assyrian and Babylonian texts project by project. Its records name the museum holding each tablet, which is where most of the institutions on this page come from. Its licence requires both credit and share-alike.",
